  ('home-022', 'home', 'If we could change one thing about our home—the layout, the location, a room, a rule—what would you pick, and what would it make possible for us?', 1, 'together', 'research', 'active', 1791676800000, 1791676800000),
  ('home-023', 'home', 'What do you wish we had talked through before we moved in together, and which of those conversations would still be worth having now?', 2, 'together', 'research', 'active', 1791676800000, 1791676800000),
  ('home-024', 'home', 'Who carries which parts of running our home—the doing, the planning, the remembering? Which part of the current split would you most like to rethink, and why?', 2, 'together', 'research', 'active', 1791676800000, 1791676800000),
  ('home-025', 'home', 'Where in our home do you feel most like yourself, and which corners still don’t quite feel like yours?', 2, 'together', 'research', 'active', 1791676800000, 1791676800000),
  ('home-026', 'home', 'How do you feel about the flow of people through our home—friends, family, overnight guests—and what would make it feel more like a refuge for you?', 2, 'together', 'research', 'active', 1791676800000, 1791676800000),
  ('home-027', 'home', 'Which household task, left undone, gets under your skin the most—and what do you think it says to you about being cared for?', 3, 'together', 'research', 'active', 1791676800000, 1791676800000),
  ('home-028', 'home', 'What part of living together has been harder for you than you expected, and what would you like {partner} to understand about it?', 3, 'together', 'research', 'active', 1791676800000, 1791676800000),
